WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.790
Does Pythagoras work for every triangle?

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:07.770
Only when one angle is exactly 90 degrees.

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:12.620
Open the angle wider, and the long side grows.

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:17.710
Then c squared is more than a squared plus b squared.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:21.013
So check for the right angle first.
